      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹9.57 (vs ₹11.35 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.57 (down from ₹11.35 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹658.5m (down 4.6% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹142.9m (down 17% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (down from 25% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 9% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
