      "date": "2026-02-04T12:00:37.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.46 (vs ₹3.21 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.46 (down from ₹3.21 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹158.9m (down 5.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹37.2m (down 23% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 23% (down from 29% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 15% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 13% per year.",
